  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 1902.08 “State LSP certification” means the certification issued by the OPLC to an individual so that the individual will qualify for Medicaid reimbursement.\n\nSource. #14429, eff 1-16-26, EXPIRES 1-16-36",
